{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_337a8354a992446a8fa4ab090c6a43e1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2d4690e8a4fb811178d51adfe17e5d2a0053ec2459e03cdc5304b7a4408b62ad","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"halfwhey/claudraband@d2b6a7d1836f snapshot 4c0e8208ff0b9c40","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6c67152263868c6d735b514bebc8d0075b9cd04a64bd507daed836d2a7af720d","slc_cab485b9ba1fcb002934bf0acbb43e32f7fed3001c1836c92a89695b2104adac","slc_e3f4f7504396535c486117d26de10eb05e212ce70224b8c5c8693a2cc004f83e","slc_fc592dc7423ba48bb7225a391ac99ebffcc1de603714a330ed92aa7cd8897ea0"],"source_ids":["src_4aaf7a35bb9d5b6e80ba4c2a7d77bc8d","src_cd8f2d1b608f5409945f74809316fa30"],"text":"Sessions run inside tmux by default both locally and in the daemon; an experimental, slower headless xterm backend exists as a fallback, and the auto backend prefers tmux then xterm.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_337a8354a992446a8fa4ab090c6a43e1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_337a8354a992446a8fa4ab090c6a43e1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_55afbbcbf562191b1161845d4c711601b71ea07acf2250a10ce06bb87f23a909","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"halfwhey/claudraband@d2b6a7d1836f snapshot 4c0e8208ff0b9c40","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_c1e1bf3ff9d743f2a9efc4f58d98f8c45f495c98051772f9ae3ea3c8faf674e5"],"source_ids":["src_cd8f2d1b608f5409945f74809316fa30"],"text":"Runtime requirements are Node.js or Bun, an already-authenticated Claude Code, and tmux for the first-class local and daemon-backed workflow.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_337a8354a992446a8fa4ab090c6a43e1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_337a8354a992446a8fa4ab090c6a43e1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_58f61386aa9b2856f068b87dc4cef410fecf5f78dbed43e20b5c8cf5f8e8c015","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"halfwhey/claudraband@d2b6a7d1836f snapshot 4c0e8208ff0b9c40","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_24ffb6859ae782d25669c084e7e1d6f952ced78ecac9b1955fac24df9f2759ca","slc_4869fac55aee026324bea432a92fe0e2995c6c30e40e2f17e312922d5f377aa8","slc_59d42ee54e7923deb8564a692e86f69c9e55fc6efa6b405a01e6427040ae0f8a","slc_fe26a2b877b7b817e5f3d52b65960cf3a212d7d4a719dbd398b217017e175803"],"source_ids":["src_4aaf7a35bb9d5b6e80ba4c2a7d77bc8d","src_cd8f2d1b608f5409945f74809316fa30"],"text":"The project is explicitly experimental and geared toward personal, ad-hoc usage rather than replacing the Claude SDK; attach only works on live sessions and does not restart dead ones.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_337a8354a992446a8fa4ab090c6a43e1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_337a8354a992446a8fa4ab090c6a43e1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6248154111f65c677675a3ddc13a16e7e6b48fde8fad797e12892503c1ff0bd8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"halfwhey/claudraband@d2b6a7d1836f snapshot 4c0e8208ff0b9c40","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4c76ec58e7315bbc563ecea7bbdb5b45bf969f128ebcd1dec07e5ce7d5c57601"],"source_ids":["src_cd8f2d1b608f5409945f74809316fa30"],"text":"The project provides resumable non-interactive workflows, an HTTP daemon for remote or headless session control, an ACP server for editor integration, and a TypeScript library for building custom tools.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_337a8354a992446a8fa4ab090c6a43e1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_337a8354a992446a8fa4ab090c6a43e1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_63b640d92add1000117cdb2530236ce74657f5c002214bc4993b8cfc68705c73","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"halfwhey/claudraband@d2b6a7d1836f snapshot 4c0e8208ff0b9c40","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_90ea2a1deebe43bcb615e99741784c4d108c15fd534a801585c5efb8910e5ed9","slc_fe26a2b877b7b817e5f3d52b65960cf3a212d7d4a719dbd398b217017e175803"],"source_ids":["src_cd8f2d1b608f5409945f74809316fa30"],"text":"The tool wraps the official Claude Code TUI in a controlled terminal rather than replacing it; it does not touch OAuth, and every interaction runs through a real Claude Code session with authentication via Claude Code.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_337a8354a992446a8fa4ab090c6a43e1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_337a8354a992446a8fa4ab090c6a43e1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6d9665f090b2c247f9936ab72b25265b23363cbdc18d2c9b4ad7a749efdc45c9","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"halfwhey/claudraband@d2b6a7d1836f snapshot 4c0e8208ff0b9c40","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2025b13557ac5b5d32429fd53897d489a995f83657e995ceb52867ac18d4ed0e","slc_a0918dd67818a286040868919c41ffdc56c5ce2cc69c119eeea33ed9474bbad2","slc_d798e8092e80e84e5d9424d76512b57b5eb9fd871d69ff5de1f775a2143642bb","slc_dc583b3fb5a4146b9580fd10d39674cab1080ce4c4be670ac6aa793bfc444c1a"],"source_ids":["src_857348cfc3515ede89022d65dcb6b326"],"text":"The daemon exposes an HTTP API mirroring CLI verbs: POST /sessions, /prompt, /send, /interrupt, GET /sessions/:id/status, /last, and an SSE /watch endpoint, with JSON error bodies and 400/404/409/500 statuses.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_337a8354a992446a8fa4ab090c6a43e1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_337a8354a992446a8fa4ab090c6a43e1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_87b62e767427d1031de95864644fb992ad7f3d919ec509c36e0ea92afaf119c0","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"halfwhey/claudraband@d2b6a7d1836f snapshot 4c0e8208ff0b9c40","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_df6c4f11791d3dd5ac81567ac000236ec098165f22c23409e83987bf261e5119","slc_eb481a058f257a794cf1ee33b2e30d83858d05f40e05e8f98bbd2d41f3657a88"],"source_ids":["src_4aaf7a35bb9d5b6e80ba4c2a7d77bc8d","src_cd8f2d1b608f5409945f74809316fa30"],"text":"The package bundles Claude Code @anthropic-ai/claude-code@2.1.96, and the CLAUDRABAND_CLAUDE_PATH environment variable can override the binary path.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_337a8354a992446a8fa4ab090c6a43e1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:26Z","created_by_operation":"op_337a8354a992446a8fa4ab090c6a43e1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b66cb0c76f0df4396995fb17655289c3576156910a1254b20e646a8955b36732","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"halfwhey/claudraband@d2b6a7d1836f snapshot 4c0e8208ff0b9c40","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_22cebe48e86d1295d80a4c565e9eb7953859774eafc3d9d54f39c798589a1641","slc_469822b01e5b1cae77fa58a30438b11e75bd85d61f1dd0fd55405d25cee7909f","slc_acdc3682d1dc67a0462353f68715acdb25ab85aa4340a94ad5829c4c5e479d64","slc_b1c801ed0aad79448bf5c8dcb40b2c5de54808442514eb6e845944ef2cec140b"],"source_ids":["src_857348cfc3515ede89022d65dcb6b326"],"text":"The SSE watch stream sends a ready event, then JSON events with monotonically increasing seq values; kinds include user_message, assistant_text, assistant_thinking, tool_call, tool_result, turn_end, system, and error, plus permission_request events.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:53:26Z","updated_by_operation":"op_337a8354a992446a8fa4ab090c6a43e1"}
